{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Dm]Bring near Aaron and his sons
[Bb]To serve me as priests a[C]mong the people
Nadab and Abi[Dm]hu Elea[Bb]zar Ithamar
[C]Chosen for [Dm]the holy task
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Bb]Fire went out [C]from be[Dm]fore the Lord
[Bb]Consumed two [C]who offered unau[Dm]tho[Bb]rized fire
Aaron [C]was silent in [Dm]the shock
Mo[Bb]ses spoke [C]with weight and [Dm]grace
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Pre-Chorus}
Do not [Bb]let your hair hang [Dm]loose
Do not [Bb]tear your garments in de[Dm]spair
[Bb]Stay at the entrance of the [Dm]tent
For the [Bb]anointing oil is upon [Asus4][A]you
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[Dm]Ithamar stands beside his [Bb]brother
Con[C]tinuing the sacred ser[Dm]vice
Overseeing the Levite [Bb]clans
